/P 103 0 R
/E (The Serverless Image Resizer was developed as part of my Cloud Computing Internship at Edutantr using Amazon Web Services \(AWS\). The main purpose of this project was to automatically resize an image whenever it was uploaded to an Amazon S3 bucket.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
207 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 103 0 R
/E (I configured an S3 bucket with an ObjectCreated trigger connected to an AWS Lambda function. The Lambda function was developed using Python and the Pillow library to process the uploaded image. After processing, the resized image was stored in the required S3 location.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
